### Page 1 of 2

```text
Planning and Development Department
2101 O’NeiI Avenue, Suite 202, Cheyenne WY 82001
(Phone) 307-637-6282 (Fax) 307-637-6366
City Council
City of Cheyenne, WY
RE: Saddle Ridge, 13th Filing Annexation and Zone Change — Revised Maps
The Annexation and Zone Change Ordinances associated with Saddle Ridge, 13th Filing were Items 11
and 12 on the City Council Agenda for April 9, 2018. The maps submitted to the City Council with these
ordinances had a minor error: the title blocks for each map misidentified the land previously platted as
Cheyenne Hills Church Subdivision. The applicant has updated the title blocks to correct the error and has
submitted revised maps for both ordinances. The revised maps (dated April 6, 2018) are attached to this
memo.
Regards,
Seth Lloyd
Planner
End:
Revised Annexation Map
Revised Zone Change Map
Cc:
City Clerk
City Attorney
Mayor’s office
.A. Ccx’.41..1t3wI’rY cF’ I4ICE
